PS3-G12-1 (new in 7.0.18, introduced by 22c9c42e): kgraphMapRbVfloMerge() hash table sized from dfixmax only,
but it first inserts every domain of the mapping computed on the free vertices (mappptr->domnnbr of them).
Few fixed vertices + many parts => table full => probe loop without exit (hang).
Build: gcc -O0 -g -fsanitize=address,undefined -I$B/include fewfix.c -o fewfix -L$B/lib -lscotch -lscotcherr -lz -lm -lpthread
  timeout 60 ./fewfix 1 64     (1 fixed vertex, 64 parts, 32x32 grid)
